    <h2>Testimony and Declarations</h2>
    <p>Testified in court cases before judges and juries in U.S. federal and state courts, the Canadian Federal Court, and a court in Malaysia. Declarations and testimony in USPTO Patent Trial and Appeal Board (PTAB) proceedings. Retained in International Trade Commission (ITC) Section 337 investigations and in domestic U.S. arbitration proceedings.</p>
